# Raven Eagle: "Whenever this creature enters or attacks, exile up to one target card from a graveyard. If a creature card
# is exiled this way, create a Clue token." Bot1 kills its own Hired Blade with Stab on turn 1, so a creature card and a
# noncreature card (the Stab) are in its graveyard; in turn 3 the Eagle enters and its trigger exiles the Hired Blade: a
# Clue is created. The Stab stays in the graveyard.

[Bot1 Deck]
Swamp
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Hired Blade
Stab
Raven Eagle
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x14

